										<p><strong>IFSC Code:</strong> SBIN0018664</p>
										<p><strong>Branch:</strong> Pettavaithalai</p>
									</div>
									</div>

								</div>

								<p class="text-center mt-3 donate-note">
									Kindly mention <strong>“Donation”</strong> in the transfer remarks.
								</p>
								</div>

							<!-- Contact -->
							<div class="mu-donate-section">
							<h4>Contact for Donations</h4>
							<p>
								<strong>Sri Ramakrishna Kudil</strong><br>
								Thirupparaithurai – 639115<br><br>
								📞 Phone: 0431-2614548, 2614235<br>
								📱 Mobile: 94435 77235, 94423 52770<br>
								📧 Email: srkudil2024@gmail.com
							</p>
							</div>

							<!-- Appeal -->
							<div class="mu-donate-section text-center">
							<h4>A Humble Appeal</h4>
							<p>
								By supporting Sri Ramakrishna Kudil, you become part of a timeless
								mission — transforming lives through education, service, and
								spiritual values. Your donation is not just charity; it is an
								investment in humanity.
							</p>
							</div>

